  "details": "Some kids are playing VR Chat who are under the age of 13.\nMost of the time it's people using other people accounts without permission and admit it. Maybe you could add a moderation option for \"user report: Underage user.\"\nIn response to a few reports of a user who says they're under age or using an other person's account, they could receive an email that automatically turns on 2 factor authentication with a 4 or 5 digit PIN.\nIf the offending user still uses the account as an underage user then they could get temporarily banned until they're at least 13 and get a parent's permission to use the app.",
